When using AdaptiveBottomSheet setting `dragHandle` to null still results in drag handle being rendered

```kotlin
AdaptiveBottomSheet(
    adaptiveSheetState = state,
    dragHandle = null,
    onDismissRequest = onDismissRequest
) {
    // Drag handle is still rendered on iOS
}
```

When using AdaptiveBottomSheet setting `dragHandle` to null still results in drag handle being rendered

```kotlin
AdaptiveBottomSheet(
    adaptiveSheetState = state,
    dragHandle = dragHandle,
    onDismissRequest = onDismissRequest
) {
    // Drag handle is still rendered on iOS
}
```
